    <div class="committees-section">
      <div class="section-label-alt">How We're Organized</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Four standing committees. One mission.</h2>
      <div class="committees-list">
        <div class="committee-row">
          <div class="comm-name">Governance &amp; Bylaws</div>
          <div class="comm-desc">Protects the structural integrity and legitimacy of the BAA. Oversees bylaws, policy, and organizational compliance.</div>
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/10sQhBCTwPs0Qwzov01AcHfeJCk_JV_wK/edit" class="comm-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Charter →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="committee-row">
          <div class="comm-name">Finance &amp; Fund Development</div>
          <div class="comm-desc">Oversees the BAA budget, financial reporting, and fund stewardship including the BAA endowment.</div>
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1B5kNiS2959wGnHLzYaH7rdKJfq6UujAB/edit" class="comm-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Charter →</a>
